@startuml
[*] --> InitialState

InitialState : Initial State

 initialState --> DesktopUI : Select Desktop UI
 initialState --> MobileUI : Select Mobile UI
 initialState --> WebUI : Select Web UI

 DesktopUI : Desktop UI
 MobileUI : Mobile UI
 WebUI : Web UI

 DesktopUI --> MobileUI : Switch to Mobile UI
 DesktopUI --> WebUI : Switch to Web UI
 DesktopUI --> [*] : Exit

 MobileUI --> DesktopUI : Switch to Desktop UI
 MobileUI --> WebUI : Switch to Web UI
 MobileUI --> [*] : Exit

 WebUI --> DesktopUI : Switch to Desktop UI
 WebUI --> MobileUI : Switch to Mobile UI
 WebUI --> [*] : Exit

 [*] --> FinalState

 FinalState : Final State
@enduml
